<div id="2026-10-01-aisystem-auto-improve-guard-health" class="cl-entry">
<h3>2026-10-01 — AI auto-improver, Super Grok auto-switch to deepseek-v4-pro, health &amp; stale-server preflight</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> (1) Admin links to <code>/ai/eval</code> and the new <code>/ai/eval/latest</code> in the admin menu, admin index, <code>/ai</code> top bar, <code>/ai/usage</code> and the AI planning pages. (2) Safe auto-improver: <code>EvalReports::auto_apply</code> applies only chain re-orderings (demote open-circuit / repeated-429 models) and cap decreases through the normal approve/apply path; each change is listed under <code>/ai/eval#auto-changes</code> with who/what/why/before/after and one-click Revert, and logged to <code>data/ai_auto_changes.jsonl</code>; cron <code>script/ai_eval_auto_improve.pl</code> at :07/:37. Report #11 proposals 35/36 (chat / docs chains: north-mini-code / nemotron-3.5-lightning first, gemma-4-31b last) applied as <em>auto (Shanta approved report #11)</em>. (3) Super Grok guard v2: locked → Hermes and app coding on <code>openrouter / deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro</code> (never flash), back to grok after the reset; admin banner, ledger row (<code>guard_switch</code>), Hermes notice file. (4) "All AI usage" table: app ledger (now tagged branch / sitename / username), AI editor, Focus-Tune, Ollama, Hermes sessions and the Today's Focus organizer. (5) <code>Comserv::Util::AI::StalePreflight</code> + <code>script/stale_preflight.pl</code> + card: STALE/OK per port/worktree, times in PT. (6) Own SuperGrok estimate from Hermes xai-oauth calls; banner + log when a meter is older than 6 h. (7) Failed-attempt waste (time, retries, 402/429, no-credit), <code>:free</code> rows booked at $0, OpenRouter day/week/month/balance in <code>org.openrouter</code>. (8) Runtime JSON untracked, 41 stale Hermes sessions archived, Ollama health (<code>script/ollama_health.pl</code>), Focus-Tune separate from the Chat ok-rate, title calls no longer counted as Hermes hops, gemma-4-26b removed.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> Shanta could not find the eval report; Super Grok hit 97% while the grok.com meter was 25 h stale; :4006 had silently stopped auto-reloading (the preflight caught it).</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>Model/AI2/EvalReports.pm</code>, <code>Controller/AI/Eval.pm</code>, <code>Model/AI2/UsageMonitor.pm</code>, <code>Util/AI/HealthChecks.pm</code>, <code>Util/AI/StalePreflight.pm</code>, <code>Model/AI/Usage.pm</code>, <code>Model/AI2/Router.pm</code>, <code>Controller/AI.pm</code>, <code>Controller/AI/Usage.pm</code>, <code>root/ai/*</code>, <code>~/.hermes/scripts/supergrok_daily_guard.py</code>; tests <code>t/ai_eval_auto_improve.t</code>, <code>t/ai_supergrok_switch.t</code>, <code>t/ai_stale_preflight.t</code>.</p>
